ion.\n\nThis powerful combination works while you sleep to support natural restoration of body balance, enhance sleep quality, and improve joint comfort. Wake up to renewed mental clarity, radiant skin, and flexible mobility. Our clean, effective formula contains no fillers or unnecessary additives, making it unlike any other detox pad on the market. Each premium botanical ingredient is thoughtfully selected and combined to create the most potent, natural cleansing experience available."}},"custom_product_accordion_FbNepw":{"type":"custom_product_accordion","settings":{"heading":"Ingredients","content_type":"text","open_by_default":false,"step_1_title":"Tear open","step_1_description":"a sealed mask — no prep","step_2_title":"Loop it on","step_2_description":"— ear loops keep it in place","step_3_title":"Feel the cold","step_3_description":"for 60+ minutes","description":"Zeolite, Ginger Root, Wormwood, Green Tea, Vitamin C, Tourmaline, Wood Vinegar, Charcoal Bamboo Vinegar, Sporopollenin"}},"custom_product_accordion_eq4gKV":{"type":"custom_product_accordion","settings":{"heading":"How To Use","content_type":"text","open_by_default":false,"step_1_title":"Tear open","step_1_description":"a sealed mask — no prep","step_2_title":"Loop it on","step_2_description":"— ear loops keep it in place","step_3_title":"Feel the cold","step_3_description":"for 60+ minutes","description":"• Apply to clean feet\n• Wear overnight while sleeping (8 hours recommended)\n• Remove in morning to reveal results\n\nImportant: For optimal results, use consistently each night. Store in a cool, dry place. Results may vary as each person's experience is unique."}}},"block_order":["989bce2f-7961-4267-8e6c-40ff4bb0ed64","judge_me_reviews_preview_badge_nTzAKc","31b79d7e-a35a-4a94-8cb5-8e518bf8fef6","1affb493-1e14-4893-9876-be8d348ee475","subscription_price_TFNRPV","shipping_notice_PW8Rzc","product_swatches_rarRUM","kaching_bundles_app_block_7NzrLF","appstle_bundles_appstle_volume_discount_bundle_Ad